<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-MEN'S AL AHRAM INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-MEN'S AL AHRAM INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the Al</p>
<p>Ahram International men's squash tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Del Harris (England) beat John White (Australia) 15-13 15-5</p>
<p>15-5</p>
<p>5-Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Peter Marshall (England) 17-14</p>
<p>15-11 15-10</p>
<p>3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat Zubair Jahan (Pakistan) 15-9</p>
<p>15-14 15-6</p>
</text>
